CHAPTER VI
INSTITUTIONS ORGANIZING PROTECTION FOR VICTIMS
Article 13
(1) The Regional Government establishes an Integrated Service Center for the Protection of Women and Children (P2TP2A) as the Organizing Institution for the integrated prevention and protection of women and children who are victims of violence.
