CHAPTER III
RIGHTS OF VICTIMS
Article 8
Every victim has the right to receive:
a. protection;
b. information;
c. optimal services;
d. continuous handling up to the rehabilitation stage; and
e. confidential handling, whether for an individual, group, or institution, whether governmental or non-governmental.
